  "general": "A simple, flat-colored digital illustration of a single character standing on a green field under a pale blue sky. The background is minimalistic with no shading or texture, emphasizing the character and the surrounding speech bubbles. The character faces forward with a neutral, calm expression and a slight smile. Eight speech bubbles with identical text are arranged evenly around the character, creating a repetitive, meme-like effect.",
  "Character 1": "A stylized, minimalistic figure with a large round head and small black dot eyes. The character has a simple curved line for a mouth, forming a gentle smile. They wear a bright red sleeveless shirt and plain blue pants. Their arms hang straight down at their sides with no visible hands. The character stands upright and centered in the image, looking directly at the viewer.",
  "Texts": "Eight speech bubbles surround the character, each containing the same text: 'Meet me near the old bridge. There is still a lot to discuss. Let us talk about it tomorrow.' The text is in English and arranged evenly around the character, reinforcing the meme format.",
